{"title":"Sleeping Ranker","synopsis":"Kita hanya akan istirahat untuk 30 detik Aku tidak sedang berkhayal kan\n\n\nIya Setelah 15 jam berburu Hyunsung meminta untuk beristirahat sejenak dan setelah 30 detik dia harus bangun dan mulai berburu lagi\n\n\nSebenarnya Hyunsung punya skill spesial\n\n\nSkill Thanatos narcolepsy telah diaktifkan\nAna telah dipaksa masuk ke dalam kondisi tidur\n\n\nSetelah tidur untuk beberapa saat dan bangun aku mendapatkan sebuah item\n\n\nPerhatikan baikbaik kisah dari Godrank class keturunan dari Thanatos Hyunsung yang tidak terhentikan","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"","artist":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Game"],"chapters":[{"id":"d6fc4a70-b3ea-45ce-a7d9-186da67a780e","number":"154","title":"Chapter 154","date":"2025-12-08","images":[]},{"id":"ca539c06-646c-47dc-9d32-9a0d96fe9b2e","number":"153","title":"Chapter 153","date":"2025-12-05","images":[]},{"id":"952b2ede-43e6-4880-be3a-715ee645fbce","number":"152","title":"Chapter 152","date":"2025-11-30","images":[]},{"id":"4653d994-643b-42e8-9677-7ebe5de660e9","number":"151","title":"Chapter 151","date":"2025-10-09","images":[]},{"id":"0c4cf1ce-2552-4ef2-881d-8b6e34e369d8","number":"150","title":"Chapter 150","date":"2025-09-30","images":[]},{"id":"eec388c3-b3d0-4add-a7b2-b0d6e901a198","number":"149","title":"Chapter 149","date":"2025-09-29","images":[]},{"id":"4bcb80d0-aae6-4136-99d7-e0ced3c87d28","number":"148","title":"Chapter 148","date":"2025-09-28","images":[]},{"id":"647e9aa2-b82f-4ccb-b4e5-66a1574a1328","number":"147","title":"Chapter 147","date":"2025-09-27","images":[]},{"id":"cd138594-b2e3-40d7-bc3b-e4fb571c0843","number":"146","title":"Chapter 146","date":"2025-09-19","images":[]},{"id":"f2d14bee-f1b9-41a1-b8df-2ee766dc72c2","number":"145","title":"Chapter 145","date":"2025-09-14","images":[]},{"id":"cb6033e6-e9b2-4039-a5dc-8cf2c8bbabd1","number":"144","title":"Chapter 144","date":"2025-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"efccc9cd-99c1-476b-adf1-6d3fd